-- Silent-wrong hunt: return a USER enum-with-data across the ABI.
-- Construction lowers RIGHT n / LEFT n to a BARE tag (payload discarded).
-- The CONSIDER-destructure path refuses, but returning the value does NOT
-- go through testPatternTy. Does this export ship supported:true with the
-- payload lost (WASM disagrees with jl4-service)?
IMPORT prelude

DECLARE Rev IS ONE OF
  RIGHT HAS rv IS A NUMBER
  LEFT  HAS lv IS A NUMBER

@export return a user enum-with-data
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A Rev
`mk rev` MEANS
  IF n GREATER THAN 0 THEN RIGHT n ELSE LEFT n
